{"units":[{"id":"L1-01","level":"第1級","order":1,"topic":"打招呼/自我介紹 (greetings, introducing yourself, family)","title_zh":"你好，我叫大衛","title_en":"Hello, I'm David","can_do_en":"I can greet a new neighbour, say my name, where I am from and what I do, talk about my family, and say goodbye."},{"id":"L1-02","level":"第1級","order":2,"topic":"便利商店","title_zh":"在便利商店","title_en":"At the convenience store","can_do_en":"I can buy a drink and a snack at a convenience store, point to what I want, answer the cashier's usual questions (hot or iced, a bag) and pay."},{"id":"L1-03","level":"第1*級","order":3,"topic":"早餐店 ordering","title_zh":"在早餐店","title_en":"At the breakfast shop","can_do_en":"I can order food and drinks for two at a breakfast shop, ask whether something is good, and answer 'for here or to go?'"},{"id":"L1-04","level":"第1*級","order":4,"topic":"手搖飲 (甜度/冰塊)","title_zh":"買手搖飲","title_en":"Ordering a hand-shaken drink","can_do_en":"I can order a drink at a drink stand, choose the size, the sugar level and the ice, and ask a friend if they want one too."},{"id":"L1-05","level":"第1級","order":5,"topic":"數字、時間、日期 (asking time, days)","title_zh":"禮拜六見！","title_en":"See you on Saturday!","can_do_en":"I can ask and tell the time, say the day and the date, and agree on when and where to meet."},{"id":"L1-06","level":"第1*級","order":6,"topic":"夜市 and prices","title_zh":"在夜市","title_en":"At the night market","can_do_en":"I can order snacks at a night-market stall, ask what things cost and the total, and understand the change I get."},{"id":"L1-07","level":"第1*級","order":7,"topic":"問路","title_zh":"請問，怎麼走？","title_en":"Asking directions","can_do_en":"I can ask where a street or place is, follow simple directions (straight on, turn at the second corner, on the left or right) and repeat them back."},{"id":"L1-08","level":"第1*級","order":8,"topic":"天氣 and small talk with neighbours","title_zh":"今天好熱喔","title_en":"Weather talk with the neighbours","can_do_en":"I can greet my neighbours, talk about hot, cold and rainy weather, and ask whether it will rain."},{"id":"L2-01","level":"第2級","order":1,"topic":"便當店 and 小吃","title_zh":"在便當店吃午餐","title_en":"Lunch at the bento shop","can_do_en":"I can order a bento for here or to go, ask for an extra item, say how the food is, and ask the owner to pack up what I can't finish."},{"id":"L2-02","level":"第2級","order":2,"topic":"機車 / 火車 / 客運","title_zh":"坐火車去高雄","title_en":"Taking the train to Kaohsiung","can_do_en":"I can choose between scooter, train and intercity bus, ask how long a trip takes and how far a place is, and ask station staff about the next train."},{"id":"L2-03","level":"第2級","order":3,"topic":"看醫生 & 健保卡","title_zh":"看醫生","title_en":"Seeing a doctor","can_do_en":"I can check in at a clinic with my health insurance card, tell the doctor what's wrong and for how long, and understand how to take my medicine."},{"id":"L2-04","level":"第2*級","order":4,"topic":"藥局","title_zh":"在藥局","title_en":"At the pharmacy","can_do_en":"I can tell a pharmacist what's wrong and since when, understand how often and how much medicine to take, and ask what to do if it doesn't get better."},{"id":"L2-05","level":"第2*級","order":5,"topic":"郵局 and 銀行/ATM","title_zh":"在郵局","title_en":"At the post office","can_do_en":"I can send a parcel abroad, choose between air and sea mail after asking how long and how much, and ask where the ATM is and whether my card costs a fee."},{"id":"L2-06","level":"第2*級","order":6,"topic":"phone & LINE","title_zh":"打電話和LINE","title_en":"Phone calls and LINE","can_do_en":"I can call a friend back, explain why I missed the call, ask them to repeat what I didn't catch, and agree on a time and place to meet, with the address sent on LINE."},{"id":"L2-07","level":"第2*級","order":7,"topic":"租房 renting","title_zh":"租房子","title_en":"Renting a room","can_do_en":"I can view a room for rent, ask about the rent, the deposit and the bills, ask whether it's noisy and where to park, and ask for a lower price."},{"id":"L2-08","level":"第2*級","order":8,"topic":"颱風 and weather, plans","title_zh":"颱風要來了","title_en":"A typhoon is coming","can_do_en":"I can talk about a coming typhoon, change a weekend plan because of the weather and say why, and understand what a neighbour tells me to get ready."}],"index":{"word:您":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:叫":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:姓":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:先生":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:太太":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:高興":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:認識":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:工作":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:英文":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:老師":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:兒子":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:歲":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:哥哥":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:姊姊":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:爸爸":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:媽媽":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:再見":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:有空":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"},{"id":"L1-05","title":"禮拜六見！"}],"word:喔":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"},{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"},{"id":"L1-05","title":"禮拜六見！"}],"word:啦":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"},{"id":"L1-03","title":"在早餐店"},{"id":"L1-05","title":"禮拜六見！"}],"grammar:G001":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"grammar:G003":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"grammar:G007":[{"id":"L1-01","title":"你好，我叫大衛"}],"word:便利商店":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:歡迎光臨":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:要":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:水":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:瓶":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:杯":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"},{"id":"L1-03","title":"在早餐店"},{"id":"L1-04","title":"買手搖飲"},{"id":"L1-06","title":"在夜市"}],"word:咖啡":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:麵包":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:這":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商店"}],"word:個":[{"id":"L1-02","title":"在便利商